# Build context rules for the one image this repo produces (the root
# Dockerfile), which every stack builds -- production, dev and test alike.
#
# The production image does carry the test suite: that is 64 KB of Python, and
# a second Dockerfile plus a second ignore file to strip it was not worth two
# extra files. The 548 KB of generated benchmark output is excluded below, and
# that was the part that actually mattered.

# Secrets -- never in any image, in any environment.
.env
.env.*
dev/.env
tests/.env

# History, virtualenvs, caches
.git
.gitignore
.venv
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage

# Produced at runtime into named volumes, not baked into the image
staticfiles/
media/

# Generated measurement output: regenerated by a run, never read by the app.
tests/loadtest/results/
tests/benchmarks/results.md

# Editor / OS noise
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
